was absolutely insane.

00:10:17.209 --> 00:10:18.499
FRANCESC CAMPOY FLORES: It was.

00:10:18.499 --> 00:10:20.840
And I tried to talk you
out of it, I remember.

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:22.860
I said, weekly is
never going to work.

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:26.199
You guys will do like 12
episodes, and that will be fun,

00:10:26.199 --> 00:10:28.490
and then it'll turn into
work, and then, by episode 20,

00:10:28.490 --> 00:10:30.448
you're going to be out
of ideas, and telling me

00:10:30.448 --> 00:10:32.030
you want to go
monthly or quarterly.

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:35.250
But I was absolutely
wrong on that,

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:38.720
I realized when you hit
episode 50 and now episode 100

00:10:38.720 --> 00:10:39.460
and whatever.

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:42.170
