00:11:32.933 --> 00:11:34.981
It really just felt
completely natural.

00:11:34.981 --> 00:11:35.480
Well, yeah.

00:11:35.480 --> 00:11:36.890
Of course, she should
be the co-host.

00:11:36.890 --> 00:11:37.290
FRANCESC CAMPOY FLORES: Yeah.

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:39.450
I think it was Mark that
