00:21:27.835 --> 00:21:29.710
MARK MANDEL: I'm pretty
sure it was diabetes.

00:21:29.710 --> 00:21:30.860
FRANCESC CAMPOY
FLORES: Yeah, diabetes.

00:21:30.860 --> 00:21:32.956
So he had to take some
drugs, and walk around,

00:21:32.956 --> 00:21:33.580
and everything.

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:36.360
And he didn't really want
to walk around that much.

00:21:36.360 --> 00:21:38.129
And since "Pokemon
Go," he has been

00:21:38.129 --> 00:21:40.420
