actually taking less drugs.

00:21:40.420 --> 00:21:41.050
MELANIE WARRICK: Nice.

00:21:41.050 --> 00:21:43.460
FRANCESC CAMPOY FLORES: And
that kind of impact is--

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:43.960
MARK MANDEL: Yeah.

00:21:43.960 --> 00:21:45.610
FRANCESC CAMPOY FLORES: Thinking
that your work in Google Cloud

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:48.370
Platform enables "Pokemon
Go" to help someone

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:49.630
with their diabetes--

00:21:49.630 --> 00:21:50.861
I'm very happy about that.

00:21:50.861 --> 00:21:51.610
MARK MANDEL: Yeah.

00:21:51.610 --> 00:21:52.940
One of my favorite
stories is that story.

00:21:52.940 --> 00:21:53.700
FRANCESC CAMPOY FLORES: Yeah.

00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:54.430
MELANIE WARRICK: Nice.

